  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You conjure a fragment of a dark star and hurl it at a creature you can see within range. Make a ranged spell attack against it; on a hit, it takes 6d12 Necrotic damage. Hit or miss, the target takes 3d12 Necrotic damage at the end of its next turn, and you regain Hit Points equal to that damage.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Both the initial and the later damage increase by 1d12 for each spell slot level above 7.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-SDHD0U6C9MvY8z6z\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Heal yourself by the damage of <em>Dark Star</em>.</p></section>",
